Reviewed `src/blog/people/drafts/Stable-Ronaldo.md` and appended a `FRESH EYES REVIEW` block at the bottom (no body edits).

**The two biggest flags:**

1. **The formula fingerprint the linter missed.** The ledger reports 0 contrast pairs, but that's because the script only catches literal "not X but Y." The actual engine of the piece is *negation-then-assertion* — "The engine is not appetite. It is accounting," "He is not describing an audience. He is describing a threshold," "Shame does that. Boredom does not" — eight instances. A reader will start hearing the template over the person. Should come down to about three.

2. **The strongest complication is locked in the skippable accordion.** His 2025 burnout hiatus — and his own line, *"Every single thing has been documented since I was 17. I never really got time off the internet"* — appears only as a Type 7 counterargument inside the Rabbit Hole. That's the moment the accounting engine ran out of gas, at the *top* of his career rather than the bottom, and anyone who closes the accordion never sees it. He also went dark off-stream in September 2025 and apologized for disappearing; the draft doesn't mention it.

Two other things worth knowing before the next pass: there's an internal contradiction on the FaZe exit (line 123 says he spent 35 minutes explaining why he left; line 239 says he left with no explanation — press coverage backs the second), and two significant omissions a viewer would notice immediately — the on-stream Boba breakup with the "one of his girlfriends" accusation, and the Stake/gambling ban, which is the sharpest available counter-evidence against the draft's own "money is a smoke detector" thesis.

Sources: [Sportskeeda — hiatus/anxiety](https://www.sportskeeda.com/us/streamers/news-i-lot-anxiety-stable-ronaldo-announces-hiatus-livestreaming-faze-subathon), [IBTimes — FaZe exits](https://www.ibtimes.co.uk/faze-clan-hit-major-exits-stable-ronaldo-silky-lacy-jasontheween-leave-1765943), [Dexerto — fifth Twitch ban](https://www.dexerto.com/twitch/faze-ronaldo-banned-from-twitch-for-fifth-time-2954840/), [Dot Esports — Martyn slap](https://dotesports.com/streaming/news/i-can-probably-sue-him-stable-ronaldo-gets-slapped-after-removing-bradley-martyns-hat), [Dexerto — CORE launch](https://www.dexerto.com/twitch/former-faze-clan-creators-rebrand-under-new-core-group-with-20m-content-house-3359297/), [Jaxon — breakup](https://www.jaxon.gg/reason-why-stableronaldos-girlfriend-broke-up-with-him/)
