## One note I rejected

**The gambling contradiction.** Verification kills it: the October 2024 ban was for accidentally showing *someone else* gambling on Stake (Dexerto, Sportskeeda), not for gambling on camera. Printing it as counter-evidence against a money-as-safety thesis would have been a manufactured tension. The 2025 hiatus does that job honestly.

