- "I'm not going to be like 'I forgive you' because I don't" (rabbit hole) is unattributed in-text — almost certainly the All Grown Up episode, but I couldn't confirm it independently.
- The Boba date is soft. Coverage is dated January 8, 2025 and describes "a viral clip from January," and a separate July 2024 on-stream breakup clip is also in circulation. I wrote "In January" without a day rather than pin it wrong.
